member.summary:
The flat namespace.key → value map for one locale, with the fallback chain merged in.
 is a comma-separated allow-list of bundles (e.g. common,blog);
omitting it returns every namespace, which only an internal caller should do.

Wiring for the localisation + runtime-config subsystem. Three lines in a host app:


builder.Services.AddKeshavLocalization(builder.Configuration);
builder.Services.AddLocalizationSeeds<MyAppSeeds>();
builder.Services.AddControllers().AddKeshavLocalizationControllers();
// …
await app.Services.InitKeshavLocalizationAsync();


The app supplies its own strings and config keys through
 — this package ships only the language-neutral baseline.
